    content:
    - You can now take a quest from the quest board. You'll find different quests
      there everyday.
    - Interact with it using "Z". Once you've taken a quest, open your menu and go
      to "Quests".
    - Once there, select the quest you want and press "Activate". After that, just
      head into the dungeon the quest has indicated.
